#### 테마 사용자화

- theme() 함수를 사용하여 axis, legend, panel, facet 같은 속성을 설정


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
r + labs(title = "Title") + theme(plot.title.position = "plot")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-10-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
r + theme(panel.background = element_rect(fill = "blue"))
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![](ggplot2-themes_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-11-1.png){width=672}
:::
:::
